Several key=value pairs in one call all land: an existing key is rewritten in place, a new
one is appended to the end of the block, and the summary lists them in argument order.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: backlog
---
# Body
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress owner=ann
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: Foo
-status: backlog
+status: in-progress
+owner: ann
 ---
 # Body
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress, owner=ann
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: in-progress
owner: ann
---
# Body
